# Execution Roadmap Binding

The product source of truth is `docs/Vokit_V1_Agency_Platform_SRS_v1.0.md`.
The implementation operating system is `docs/execution/`.

## Before coding
- Gate 0 is accepted (owner proceed 2026-09-10). Follow `docs/execution/13-DEVELOPMENT-ROADMAP.md` in order.
- Phase 1 is foundation only. Do not implement tenant routing, recordings, the payment ledger, identity, or React portals until their phase.
- ADR-001 through ADR-005 are Accepted. Do not reopen them unless the owner asks.
- Agency KYC is external (Q-015). Do not store KYC document bytes as the system of record.
- Customer remains under Agency scope (Q-016). Do not implement per-customer DBs or cross-agency customer moves in the initial build.
- Follow `docs/execution/13-DEVELOPMENT-ROADMAP.md` in order. Do not skip to CRUD or UI chrome.

## Authority
SRS → OPEN-QUESTIONS Decided → accepted ADRs → existing Pipecat/SIP Edge/Asterisk contracts → `docs/execution/*` → current code.

## Every non-trivial task
Use the method and Required Task Report in `MASTER-CURSOR-BOOTSTRAP.md` and `docs/execution/14-CURSOR-MASTER-GUIDE.md`.
Use named workflows in `docs/execution/15-CURSOR-WORKFLOWS.md`.

## Physical tenancy
Agency is the physical MySQL tenant. Customer is a child scope. The browser never selects a database.
